:: Next Message {"position":"800,500","size":"100,100"}
Well, that, and I had to make a few changes to this fine establishment. We've been hiring actual exterminators now. Of course, I managed to make fine Happiness Supervisors out of all four of them, but one of them didn't quit, and I'm pleased to announce that they finally killed all the rats. Legally, they had to agree to being a Happiness Supervisor, of course, but this new guy seems to actually be enjoying his job.

[[Next Message ]]



:: Next Message\  {"position":"800,625","size":"100,100"}
What was the point of this announcement again? I can't remember...

[[Next Message  ]]



:: Next Message\ \  {"position":"800,750","size":"100,100"}
Oh yes! Happiness Supervisor Bob, can I have some cheese? Just send it up through the hatch system, you should know what to do.

[[Next Message   ]]



:: Next Message\ \ \  {"position":"800,875","size":"100,100"}
Thanks Bob.

