Oh look. My alpaca keyring.



:: Start {"position":"800,375","size":"100,100"}
This is a public announcement across the Grandchain Network. 

It's been about 6 months since I got a legal notice for the rat infestation we had a couple of months ago, and I'm pleased to announce that we finally settled. I only had to pay about £100,000 compensation, which I was able to afford through my copyright battle with every drink company over the use of the word 'Drink'. That's OUR brand name!

[[Next Message]]

